<%# Warehoused reply — the email couldn't be auto-filed by the Deal Update Agent. %>
<h2>Your update needs manual review</h2>

<p>
  We received your email for <strong><%= @deal.name %></strong>, but couldn't file it automatically.
</p>

<% if @reason == "unknown_intent" %>
  <p>
    <strong>Reason:</strong> We couldn't determine whether this was a meeting note or a task.
    Try rephrasing your email to clearly describe a meeting/call (for a note) or an action item (for a task).
  </p>
<% else %>
  <p>
    <strong>Reason:</strong> We couldn't match
    <strong>"<%= @stakeholder_string %>"</strong>
    to any investor on this deal.
    Check the spelling or use the investor's full name as it appears on the deal board.
  </p>
<% end %>

<% if @body_preview.present? %>
  <p style="color: #666; border-left: 3px solid #ddd; padding-left: 12px; margin: 16px 0;">
    <%= @body_preview %>
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  Your email has been saved to the <strong>Warehouse</strong> tab on the deal page,
  where a team member can review and file it manually.
</p>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #888;">
  This message was sent by the Deal Update Agent.
  No action is required — a team member will review the warehoused item.
</p>
